<p>President Trump said Israel and Lebanon agreed to extend their ceasefire by three weeks after White House talks, delaying a truce that had been set to expire in the coming days. The extension followed a second round of high-level talks in Washington between Israeli and Lebanese representatives. Several reports called the meeting unusual or rare, since Israel and Lebanon do not have formal diplomatic relations.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/EW8oK_5_7LEp2bqNSKM73IxhpEQFKhsOxDtf3tACIFM-ZDiZuXB-HygYta00T-WW6csQZnQHsOKR6DfnM8xwDW7w-Y50F6GPRVbCizO1tEQ3hwzFogwt62kv2Z3OOrDbiMN1yNsB98oLMuDHqkVnWOPZcvFBhdt7wCGot4Hrlj4KP1fiwQ' alt='US President Donald Trump speaks at the White House as US, Israeli and Lebanese officials listen on April 23, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Truce violations: The extension came despite fresh accusations from both sides. The Israeli military said it intercepted projectiles from Lebanon, while Hezbollah said it targeted the Shtula area after deadly Israeli strikes in Lebanon.</li><li>Hezbollah absent: Hezbollah did not take part in the Washington talks, even though the ceasefire centers on fighting between Israel and the Iranian-backed group in Lebanon.</li><li>US security role: Trump said Washington &quot;is going to work with Lebanon in order to protect itself from Hezbollah,&quot; signaling continued US involvement beyond brokering the extension.</li></ul><blockquote>I think there’s a very good chance of having peace. I think it should be an easy one. - President Donald Trump</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>President Trump: He said he was willing to wait for what he called the &quot;best deal&quot; with Iran rather than rush negotiations, while presenting the Israel-Lebanon extension as part of a broader push for regional peace. (<a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/middle-east/israel-lebanon-extend-ceasefire-as-trump-seeks-best-deal-with-iran'>The Straits Times</a>)</li><li>Hezbollah: The group said it launched a rocket attack on the Shtula area after Israeli strikes, underscoring that armed friction continued even as diplomats extended the truce. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/apr/24/iran-war-live-updates-trump-hormuz-strait-israel-lebanon-truce'>The Guardian</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/middle-east/israel-lebanon-extend-ceasefire-as-trump-seeks-best-deal-with-iran'>Israel, Lebanon extend ceasefire as Trump seeks ‘best deal’ with Iran</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/live-updates/iran-war-trump-video-strait-of-hormuz-ship-attack-ceasefire-lebanon/'>Israel-Lebanon ceasefire extended by 3 weeks, Trump says</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/live/2026/04/23/world/iran-war-trump-news'>Trump Says Israel and Lebanon Agree to Extend Cease-Fire</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/04/24/trump-announces-a-three-week-extension-of-the-israel-lebanon-ceasefire_6752764_4.html'>Trump announces three-week extension for Israel-Lebanon ceasefire</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='https://www.rferl.org/a/iran-war-us-hormuz-oil-blockade-gulf-israel/33640284.html'>Trump Says Israeli-Lebanese Cease-Fire Extended 3 Weeks, Even As Violence Flares</a> - rferl.org</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/politics/watch-trump-announces-israel-and-lebanon-have-agreed-to-3-week-ceasefire-extension'>WATCH: Trump announces Israel and Lebanon have agreed to 3-week ceasefire extension</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/israel-lebanon-to-extend-ceasefire-as-us-iran-talks-stall/live-76918799'>Israel, Lebanon to extend ceasefire as US-Iran talks stall</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/israel-hezbollah-ceasefire-extended-by-3-weeks-says-trump/article70899310.ece'>Israel-Hezbollah ceasefire extended by 3 weeks, says Trump</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='http